 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 760M (radeonsi, gfx1103_r1, LLVM 19.1.1, DRM 3.57, 6.8.0-63-generic) - AMD Ryzen 5 7640U w/ Radeon 760M Graphics (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe buttons `Pause Running Project` (Editor) and `Suspend` (DEBUG window) are not synchronized.\nInstead, there are two independent layers of suspending.\nWhile at least one of them is enabled, the project is suspended.\n\nIf this should be intended, I suggest not re-using the exact same sign for clarity.\nCurrently, they look identical, so the same (shared) functionality is expected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Click `Run Project`\n- Click `Pause` (Editor)\n- Click `Suspend` (DEBUG window)\n- Project is now suspended twice\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108424/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo